\f0\fs28\b Yamaha YAS-209\b0\fs20\par
\par
DriverWorks driver for the Yamaha \b YAS-209\b0  soundbar (Linkplay platform). Presents to Control4 as a \b Receiver\b0  proxy: power, volume, mute, input select and surround mode.\par
\par
Two control methods are available. \b IR is the default and needs no configuration.\b0  IP adds state feedback and exact control, and is described under \b IP Control\b0  below.\par
\par
